SETUP monorepo project
------------

## 1. Install pnpm

  If you already have Node.js installed:
  
  npm install -g pnpm
  node -v
  pnpm -v

## 2. Create the project

  mkdir ecommerce 
  cd ecommerce

  pnpm init
  ```

  Create:

  ```text
  apps/
  packages/
  ```

  On Windows:

  ```powershell
  mkdir apps
  mkdir packages
  ```

## 3. Create `pnpm-workspace.yaml`

At the root:

```yaml
packages:
  - "apps/*"
  - "packages/*"
```
This tells pnpm:
    > Treat every directory under `apps` and `packages` as a workspace package.

