## 4. Root `package.j

## 1. Root `package.json`

Create:

```json
{
  "name": "ecommerce-nodejs",
  "private": true,
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "packageManager": "pnpm@10.15.0",
  "scripts": {
    "dev:user": "pnpm --filter user-service start",
    "dev:product": "pnpm --filter product-service start",
    "dev:order": "pnpm --filter order-service start",
    "build": "pnpm -r run build",
    "start": "pnpm -r --parallel start"
  }
}
```

The important part is:

```json
"private": true
```

because this is the root of the monorepo.

