# 2. `pnpm-workspace.yaml`

Create this at the root:

```yaml
packages:
  - "apps/*"
  - "packages/*"
```

This tells pnpm:

> Treat everything under `apps` and `packages` as workspace packages.

So pnpm discovers:

```text
apps/user-service
apps/product-service
apps/order-service
packages/shared

mkdir -p apps/user-service  apps/product-service apps/order-service packages/shared
```

