# 8. The important difference in local development

Because all services use:

```javascript
const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;
```

you need different ports when running all three locally.

For example:

```text
User       → 3001
Product    → 3002
Order      → 3003
```

You can run:

```bash
PORT=3001 pnpm --filter user-service start
```

```bash
PORT=3002 pnpm --filter product-service start
```

```bash
PORT=3003 \
USER_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3001 \
PRODUCT_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3002 \
pnpm --filter order-service start
```

On Windows PowerShell:

```powershell
$env:PORT="3001"; pnpm --filter user-service start
```

etc.

